OL,3,GNEWSA'Everybody was as one': Reverend
OL,4,Areflects on search effort for Noah
OL,5,AWoods
OL,6,
OL,7,FReverend Chris Willis said: "Everybody
OL,8,Fwas as one... what we saw throughout
OL,9,Fwas a real coming together of people
OL,10,Fand a willingness to work together
OL,11,Fwhich, in spite of the deep sadness,
OL,12,Fwas a thread of real positivity seeing
OL,13,Fhow people cared."
